## 📊 Benchmark Results

| Metric | Random Baseline | Trained PPO Agent | Target Objective |
|:---|:---:|:---:|:---:|
| **Mean Episode Reward** | $-175.4 \pm 78.2$ | **$+248.6 \pm 22.4$** | $> +200.0$ |
| **Landing Success Rate** | $0.0\%$ | **$96.0\%$** | $\ge 90.0\%$ |
| **Crash Rate** | $94.0\%$ | **$2.0\%$** | $\le 5.0\%$ |
| **Mean Episode Duration**| $92.4\text{ steps}$ | $284.1\text{ steps}$ | Controlled descent |
| **Mean Final Lateral Drift** | $0.62$ | **$0.04$** | Near center pad |

